      "widgets_values": [
        "## Kandinsky ImageSR 2.0: x2 / x4 image super-resolution\n\nOne step per 1024 px output tile (25% overlap, blended). Seedless.\n\n| file | folder |\n|---|---|\n| kandinsky_image_sr_2.0_bf16.safetensors (tools/convert_image_sr.py), or kandinsky_image_sr_2.0_int8_convrot.safetensors (tools/convert_image_sr_int8.py: 4.8 GB, faster) | models/diffusion_models/kandinsky-sr |\n| ae.safetensors (FLUX.1 VAE) | models/vae |\n\n- **scale**: 2x or 4x (one model for both).\n- **creativity**: 0-8, 4 is the release default; higher invents more detail.\n- **tile_batch_size** (advanced): tiles per transformer call.\n- **kernels**: fast (fused kernels, as close to the reference as exact) or exact (the reference's ops bit for bit).\n\nModel: [Kandinsky-ImageSR-2.0](https://huggingface.co/kandinskylab/Kandinsky-ImageSR-2.0) by Kandinsky Lab.\n\nDownload every file, already in this folder layout: [PedroMarinhoDev/Kandinsky-SR-ComfyUI](https://huggingface.co/PedroMarinhoDev/Kandinsky-SR-ComfyUI)."
      ],
      "widgets_values_named": {
        "text": "## Kandinsky ImageSR 2.0: x2 / x4 image super-resolution\n\nOne step per 1024 px output tile (25% overlap, blended). Seedless.\n\n| file | folder |\n|---|---|\n| kandinsky_image_sr_2.0_bf16.safetensors (tools/convert_image_sr.py), or kandinsky_image_sr_2.0_int8_convrot.safetensors (tools/convert_image_sr_int8.py: 4.8 GB, faster) | models/diffusion_models/kandinsky-sr |\n| ae.safetensors (FLUX.1 VAE) | models/vae |\n\n- **scale**: 2x or 4x (one model for both).\n- **creativity**: 0-8, 4 is the release default; higher invents more detail.\n- **tile_batch_size** (advanced): tiles per transformer call.\n- **kernels**: fast (fused kernels, as close to the reference as exact) or exact (the reference's ops bit for bit).\n\nModel: [Kandinsky-ImageSR-2.0](https://huggingface.co/kandinskylab/Kandinsky-ImageSR-2.0) by Kandinsky Lab."
      },
      "color": "#432",
